\par\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0 \~\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93He [Nietzsche] did not see that the evil he was fighting [resentment] was a relatively minor evil compared to the more violent forms of vengeance\u8230\'85.Such frivolity could flourish only in our privileged centuries, in privileged parts of the world where real vengeance had retreated so much that its terror had become unintelligible.\u8221\'94\line }
